"1. Open Jellyfin in the browser or in the app, signed in as the user tvjoe "
"should work with.\n"
"2. Click the round user icon at the top right.\n"
"3. In the menu that opens, choose “Quick Connect” (between “Metadata "
"manager” and “Sign out”), enter the code and confirm.\n"
"\n"
"tvjoe waits up to 5 minutes and then closes this dialog by itself."

